  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 2270,
      "text": "1 · First open (everyone)",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 1 — first time only\n\nWelcome → pick language (saved) → Sign in with Google or email → name + mobile → choose Volunteer or Admin.\n\nVolunteer → row 2 (left).\nAdmin → row 2 (right).\n\nOne account = one role.",
      "fill": "blue"
    },
    {
      "id": "key",
      "x": 2790,
      "y": 300,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "COLOUR KEY (same on every screen)\n\nGreen = ours / done\nAmber = target (can win)\nRed = opposition / alert\nGrey = not met yet\nBlue = actions & menu\nPurple = tasks"
    },
    {
      "id": "t2",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1190,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 2740,
      "text": "2 · Joining (volunteer) or asking to be admin",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 1490,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 2a — volunteer\n\nScan the admin's QR (or type the code) → team shows, locked → tap your booths → Send → wait.\nWhen the admin approves, the app opens Home (row 3).\n\nFLOW 2b — admin (right)\nParty + state → pick assemblies (or whole state) → Send → wait for super-admin.\nWhen approved, the app opens the Dashboard (row 6).",
      "fill": "green"
    },
    {
      "id": "t3",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2380,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 3210,
      "text": "3 · Volunteer daily work",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 2680,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 3 — every day\n\nHome shows progress (ring) and the NEXT VOTER.\nTap Meet → tap Ours / Maybe / Other → Save & next → the next voter opens.\nNo internet? It saves on the phone and sends later.\n\nOther tiles on Home: Find voter, Tasks, Families, Polling day.",
      "fill": "green"
    },
    {
      "id": "t4",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3570,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 2740,
      "text": "4 · Volunteer menu & account",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 3870,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 4\n\nTap your photo (top left) or Menu (bottom) → side menu with every page.\nProfile = who I am + my week.\nSettings = language, text size, alerts, sync, sign out.\nAccess paused shows only if the team's plan ends.",
      "fill": "gray"
    },
    {
      "id": "t5",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4760,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 1330,
      "text": "5 · Polling day",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 5060,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 5 — election day\n\nVolunteer at the booth types the serial number → name appears → tap Voted (number clears by itself).\nAdmin watches live turnout, sees alerts (volunteer left booth, low turnout) and calls them in one tap.",
      "fill": "red"
    },
    {
      "id": "t6",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 5950,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 3210,
      "text": "6 · Admin daily work",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "x": 3290,
      "y": 6250,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 6 — every day\n\nDashboard opens with the GOAL (80% by polling day) and whether you are on track.\n'Needs you today' lists problems, each with its fix: Assign (no volunteer) · Open (zone behind) · Remind (quiet volunteers) · Review (waiting to join).\nThen Map → Booth → Assign, Tasks, Zones, Families.",
      "fill": "orange"
    },
    {
      "id": "t7",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8330,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 2740,
      "text": "7 · Admin menu & tools",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 8630,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 7\n\nMenu (bottom right) → side menu.\nTeam QR = invite volunteers (they scan it in 2.1).\nHome banner = photo on every volunteer's Home.\nAll my assemblies only if you manage more than one.",
      "fill": "gray"
    },
    {
      "id": "t8",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9520,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 1360,
      "text": "8 · Admin on the website",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 9820,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 8\n\nSame admin pages on a computer: menu on the left, numbers and tables wider. Phones use rows 6–7.",
      "fill": "gray"
    },
    {
      "id": "t6b",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 7140,
      "w": 240,
      "maxW": 1800,
      "text": "6b · Summaries: assembly → zone → booth",
      "kind": "title1"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6b",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 7440,
      "w": 360,
      "text": "FLOW 6b — insights & drill down\n\nDashboard goal card → Insights: pace vs goal, voters turned to ours, best time to campaign, groups we are missing (one tap starts a task), top volunteers.\nBig numbers → Assembly summary → tap a zone → Zone summary → all booths → Booth detail (6.4).",
      "fill": "orange"
    }
  ],
